@title EMC filter fix: the added filter is a to-do until it is drawn and wired; the finding stays
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Check > EMC check, "Preview: Add a mains filter ...". The filter is added to the device list only: it is not drawn on a page, so it filters nothing. The preview says so and EMC-07 does not clear. (Tadjiro laptop test, finding 8.)
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-bonding.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "EMC check"
scroll 360 400 -300
wait 10
expect "Preview: Add a mains filter"
click_text "Preview: Add a mains filter" #1
wait 10
expect "Preview on a copy of the project"
expect "not drawn yet and filters nothing"
expect_not "Clears EMC-07"
shot 01-preview
check_layout
click_text "Apply (one undo step)"
wait 15
expect "The finding stays until it is wired"
shot 02-applied
check_layout
